            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Ink or hard pencil on dark olive-brown paper, one line with the points written out, both panels agree. Both 8s show two closed bowls, and the month figure has the same form as the 1 of 18."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       }
